WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.4 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Board and management responsibilities

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Write down which decisions belong to the board, then plan when it reviews them.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. List reserved matters precisely, with money limits.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Delegate everything else within budget and policy.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Set a yearly calendar of what is reviewed and when.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Pan del Barrio (Social enterprise · company, Peru)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Pan del Barrio: only the shareholders can change the bylaws, adopt BIC status or pay dividends; both directors approve loans.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write your reserved matters and a governance calendar.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
